     "6af863a9-1098-c609-1a98-7af3a112ad53"]], "TableText",ExpressionUUID->
     "055bc2ad-6b92-a3be-3378-dbf70e24f184"], Cell["\<\
probability of exploring each branch; below 1 prunes stochastically\
\>", "TableText",ExpressionUUID->"2b0fb60e-2211-365f-5934-286857a59ca5"]},
   {Cell["      ", "ModInfo",ExpressionUUID->
     "201a2509-bdd9-2fa1-5039-bd53346c758b"], Cell[TextData[Cell[
